{"2317220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Break//Down", "steam_appid": 2317220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/84d29ee501c3ad9282c72461ee81c8e8.avif?t=1781531414\" width=1212 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project: Break//Down is an experimental 3D action-adventure brawler with a unique limb-based combat system. In this game you explore the EZON complex, a mass production and distribution facility secretly gone rogue in the shoes of 2 fools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/7d8cccce8a2752b41d537874ce03dca5.poster.avif?t=1781531414\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/7d8cccce8a2752b41d537874ce03dca5.webm?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/7d8cccce8a2752b41d537874ce03dca5.mp4?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/cf91a1678c82083a99339f98ad44b4cd.avif?t=1781531414\" width=1212 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project: Break//Down utilises a unique physics-based limb system where you can disable, dismantle and destroy your enemies. The limb system allows for dynamic flinch and ragdoll to allow for the satisfying feeling of weight and impact to every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/2f5ea4327766f8cb0c64d2f405ba995e.poster.avif?t=1781531414\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/2f5ea4327766f8cb0c64d2f405ba995e.webm?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/2f5ea4327766f8cb0c64d2f405ba995e.mp4?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/670cf3af8d86c880ab6356ea56f8d606.avif?t=1781531414\" width=1212 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab anything in the environment you can get your hands on to dynamically change how you fight your enemies from; bottles, paint cans, an old pole, a plank of wood or even your foe's limbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/1f7a6f6d0ad93190afef269f70dcbad0.poster.avif?t=1781531414\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/1f7a6f6d0ad93190afef269f70dcbad0.webm?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/1f7a6f6d0ad93190afef269f70dcbad0.mp4?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/a6ae5595f72149f1c3c392d21d21139e.avif?t=1781531414\" width=1212 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use physics and magnetic abilities to cause havoc and chaos for your foes in combat<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/8230cf50e16afa2802c9b38de41b22f8.poster.avif?t=1781531414\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/8230cf50e16afa2802c9b38de41b22f8.webm?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/8230cf50e16afa2802c9b38de41b22f8.mp4?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/3f97321e8b1733035465007f225a31cb.avif?t=1781531414\" width=1212 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the facility after a secret robot revolution and discover the madness and shenanigans of the facility formed from laziness and incompetence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/d9e36d9d87055dfac5be4a687e948a3f.poster.avif?t=1781531414\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/d9e36d9d87055dfac5be4a687e948a3f.webm?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/d9e36d9d87055dfac5be4a687e948a3f.mp4?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/84d29ee501c3ad9282c72461ee81c8e8.avif?t=1781531414\" width=1212 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project: Break//Down is an experimental 3D action-adventure brawler with a unique limb-based combat system. In this game you explore the EZON complex, a mass production and distribution facility secretly gone rogue in the shoes of 2 fools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/7d8cccce8a2752b41d537874ce03dca5.poster.avif?t=1781531414\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/7d8cccce8a2752b41d537874ce03dca5.webm?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/7d8cccce8a2752b41d537874ce03dca5.mp4?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/cf91a1678c82083a99339f98ad44b4cd.avif?t=1781531414\" width=1212 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project: Break//Down utilises a unique physics-based limb system where you can disable, dismantle and destroy your enemies. The limb system allows for dynamic flinch and ragdoll to allow for the satisfying feeling of weight and impact to every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/2f5ea4327766f8cb0c64d2f405ba995e.poster.avif?t=1781531414\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/2f5ea4327766f8cb0c64d2f405ba995e.webm?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/2f5ea4327766f8cb0c64d2f405ba995e.mp4?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/670cf3af8d86c880ab6356ea56f8d606.avif?t=1781531414\" width=1212 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab anything in the environment you can get your hands on to dynamically change how you fight your enemies from; bottles, paint cans, an old pole, a plank of wood or even your foe's limbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/1f7a6f6d0ad93190afef269f70dcbad0.poster.avif?t=1781531414\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/1f7a6f6d0ad93190afef269f70dcbad0.webm?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/1f7a6f6d0ad93190afef269f70dcbad0.mp4?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/a6ae5595f72149f1c3c392d21d21139e.avif?t=1781531414\" width=1212 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use physics and magnetic abilities to cause havoc and chaos for your foes in combat<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/8230cf50e16afa2802c9b38de41b22f8.poster.avif?t=1781531414\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/8230cf50e16afa2802c9b38de41b22f8.webm?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/8230cf50e16afa2802c9b38de41b22f8.mp4?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/3f97321e8b1733035465007f225a31cb.avif?t=1781531414\" width=1212 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the facility after a secret robot revolution and discover the madness and shenanigans of the facility formed from laziness and incompetence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/d9e36d9d87055dfac5be4a687e948a3f.poster.avif?t=1781531414\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/d9e36d9d87055dfac5be4a687e948a3f.webm?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/extras/d9e36d9d87055dfac5be4a687e948a3f.mp4?t=1781531414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Project: Break//Down is a single-player, experimental 3D, action-adventure, brawler with a unique limb-based combat system that allows for satisfying combat. In this game you explore the EZON complex a mass production and distribution facility secretly gone rogue in the shoes of 2 fools.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/58040e66fffebb9c7b8f9e2c7a16e68da35004ce/header.jpg?t=1781531414", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/214a6fddff7523e803097948fc1cec5de32f19f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781531414", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317220/214a6fddff7523e803097948fc1cec5de32f19f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781531414", "website": "https://www.fistfacestudios.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 10th Gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> It works on a ThinkPad</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Milan Manji"